{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20491","headline":"和卢常侍寄华山郑隐者 · 张籍","name":"和卢常侍寄华山郑隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独住三峰下，年深学炼丹。\n一间松叶屋，数片石花冠。\n酒待山中饮，琴将洞口弹。\n开门移远竹，剪草出幽兰。\n荒壁通泉架，晴崖晒药坛。\n寄知骑省客，长向白云闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}